#AREA High Mound~
#AUTHORS Leza~





#HELPS
-1 HIGHMOUND~
Since the war started with the, spits on the ground, elves. The ogre has come
together to built a headquarter to regroup their tactics and gather new
soldiers. It is said that it's impossible to infiltrate this structure. The
security around and inside the building is so tight, if you sneeze, they'll
know. Many have tried, but none has succeeded. With that in mind, it gives
the ogre great hopes that their plan will succeed.~
0 $~




#RANGES 0 99 0 99
#MOBILES
#1850
General Urik~
General Urik~
General Urik stands here looking over all the possible recruitees.~
The general had been in many wars and seen quite a few troops comes and goes,
so he has a sense of who would make a great soldiers. That is why the military
relies on him to recruit soldiers who can hack it in this war.~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_STAY_AREA|ACT_SMART|ACT_NO_ORDER
AFF_DETECT_INVIS|AFF_DETECT_HIDDEN|AFF_UNDERSTAND|AFF_TONGUES
0 S
95 0 0 0d0+10000 0d0+200
0 780605
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>greet_prog 100~
if race($n) != 7
  tell $n You're not authorize to be here.
  mpforce $n west
endif
~
>greet_prog 75~
if quest(0,2,$n) == 0
  if rand(50)
    look $n
    mpechoat You notice a smile on his face. He seems to like what he saw.
    say You look like a strong ogre who knows how to
    say take care of himself. Care to join the army
    say and shows those elf what you're made of?
  else
    look $n
    say Look at those muscle bulging from your arms,
    say man what I wouldn't give to have someone like
    say you in the army. Those elf would be shaking where
    say they stand if they saw you coming. What do you say?
  endif
~
>speech_prog yes~
if quest(0,2,$n) == 0
  if race($n) == 7
    say Alright!
    mpechoat $n The General pat you on the back.
    say To join the army, type JOIN ARMY password right here.
    tell $n Go see the Commander, he's located at the end of the hallway.
    mpmset $n quest 0 2 1
    tell $n To enter the headquarter, head back to the recruiter and say ENTER
    mpechoat $n The General wish you luck out in the battlefield.
  else
    mpforce $n west
  endif
endif
~
>rand_prog 30~
mpecho You hear a choir of voices in the background.  
mpecho Be all you can be in the Ogre Army! JOIN the army now!
~
|
