#1859
Ulga~
Commander Ulga~
Commander Ulga is here sitting behind his desk.~
You see a very big and ugly ogre before you, but I wouldn't want to mention
that to him. He's just a bit conscious about his appearance. Besides being
ugly, his battle scars improves his looks a bit. He might not look good, but 
he sure knows how to win a war.~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_STAY_AREA|ACT_SMART|ACT_NO_ORDER
AFF_DETECT_INVIS|AFF_DETECT_HIDDEN|AFF_SANCTUARY|AFF_UNDERSTAND|AFF_TONGUES
0 S
95 0 0 0d0+10000 0d0+200
0 780605
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>greet_prog 100~
if race($n) == 7
  if quest(0,2,$n) == 1
    shake $n
    tell $n Congratulations! We're always looking for good soldiers.
    tell $n To help you in the battles out there, here's a teleporter.
    tell $n It'll take you back to the Ogres' Headquarters in a jiffy.
    mpoload 1862
    mpquiet on
    cast 'giant strength' $n
    mpquiet off
    give i1862 $n
    tell $n Well good luck soldiers.
    emote salutes you.
    mpforce $n emote salutes the Commander.
    mpmset $n quest 0 2 2
  else
    say What can I do for you?
    say If you need another teleporter, say I need another teleporter.
  endif
else
  if race($n) == 2
    tell $n Think I wouldn't notice a spy within my headquarters hey.
    tell $n Well think again, I know all that goes within these walls.
    tell $n You have been found quilty of treason against the ogre race.
    tell $n The sentence is death.
    shout I have found a spy within these walls.
    shout I, Commander Ulga, has found $n quilty of treason.
    shout $s sentence is death, and will be executed immeadiately.
    mpechoat $n You feel a blow on your head as you slip into unconsciousness.
    mpechoat $n *splash* A bucket of water was thrown on you.
    mpechoat $n You notice that they put you in a gullotine.
    mpecho The Commander shouted out 'Commence!'
    mpecho The executioner pulls the rope...
    mpforce $n shout Long live the e..l...v...e.....
    mpechoat $n The last thing you heard was the Commander hedious laugh.
    mptransfer $n 9755
    mpat $n mpechoat $n You woke up and found yourself lying in Chakkor.
    mpat $n mpechoat $n Next to you is a note.
    mpat $n mpechoat $n It says, be this as a warning, the next time I catch you.
    mpat $n mpechoat $n It'll be for real. You will forfeit your LIFE!
  else
    tell $n You don't belong here, begone with you.
    mptransfer $n 9755
  endif
endif
~
>speech_prog p I need another teleporter.~
say What! You lost it already. That does not bode well for you.
say The military can't afford to give you another one for free.
say Give me 10,000 credits and I'll give you another one.
~
>bribe_prog 10000~
mpoload 1862
mpquiet on
cast 'giant strength' $n
mpquiet off
give i1862 $n
drop i1862
~
|
#1860
recruiter~
a recruiter~
A recruiter is here shouting at you to join the army.~
He looks fairly young to be in the army, but a yound ogre is still very tough
in battle though they lack experience.~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_STAY_AREA|ACT_SMART|ACT_NO_ORDER
AFF_DETECT_INVIS|AFF_DETECT_HIDDEN|AFF_UNDERSTAND|AFF_TONGUES
0 S
95 0 0 0d0+10000 0d0+200
0 780605
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>all_greet_prog 100~
if race($n)==2
  shout $n is a spy!
  mpechoat $n The recruiter knocks you senseless with a large club.
  mptransfer $n 9755
  mpat $n mpforce $n shout I'm a stinking elf spy who fail my mission to infiltrate the Ogres' HQ.
  mpat $n mpechoat $n Those bastard must of done something to me to force me to say that.
else
  if race($n)!=7
    say Sorry, ogres only.
    mpechoat $n The recruiter reach for his medallion and point his finger at you.
    mpechoaround $n The recruiter reach for his medallion and point his finger at $n.
    mptransfer $n 9755
    mpecho $n has vanish from the room.
    mpat $n mpechoat $n You feel a dizzy sensation, and when you regain your senses.
    mpat $n mpechoat $n You notice you're back at Chakkor.
  else
    if level($n)<10
      tell $n You're not old or experience enough to join the army
      tell $n at this time, please come later.
      mpechoat $n The recruiter told you to jog back to Chakkor to strengthen
      mpechoat $n your body and mind for the day you come of age to join them.
      mpechoat $n You begin the long jog back.
      mpechoat $n Looking back, you shout 'I'll be back and when I do, you'll be
      mpechoat $n begging me to join you.'
      mptransfer $n 9755
    else
      if quest(0,2,$n) > 0
        emote salutes you.
        say Welcome back soldier.
        tell $n When you're ready, say ENTER to enter the headquarters.
      else
        say Welcome to the Ogre Recruitment Center. We're always looking for
        say a few good ogres to put the elf in their places or in the menu.
        say Are you that ogre? Well if you are, head east and JOIN the army now!
      endif
    endif
  endif
endif
~
>rand_prog 20~
if ispc($r)
  if race($r) == 7
    say What are you waiting for, $r, go JOIN the army.
    say Don't stand around and wait to be drafted.
  else
    if race($n)==2
      shout $n is a spy!
      mpechoat $n The recruiter knocks you senseless with a large club.
      mptransfer $n 9755
      mpat $n mpforce $n shout I'm a stinking elf spy who fail my mission to infiltrate the Ogres' HQ.
      mpat $n mpechoat $n Those bastard must of done something to me to force me to say that.
    else
      tell $r Sorry, Ogres only.
      mpechoat $r The recruiter escort you into a catapult.
      mpecho 3-2-1! Fire!
      mpechoat $r You're flying through the air.
      mptransfer $r 9755
      mpat $n mpforce $n shout Watchout!
      mpat $n mpechoaround $n You saw $n, crashing into the ground next to you.
    endif
  endif
endif
~
>speech_prog enter~
if quest(0,2,$n) > 0
  mpechoat $n A voice calls out, 'You may enter.'
  mptransfer $n 1852
else
  tell $n You're not in the army. Enter the adjacent room to join now.
  tell $n If you're already in the army, enter the adjacent room anyway
  tell $n to add you names to the list.
endif
~
|
