teleporter~
Command: ogrehq
This will take you back to the Ogres' Headquarter, but you must have at least
90% hitpoints. Otherwise it won't work.~
A
APPLY_STR 1
A
APPLY_AC -5
P 1
TRIG_TICK 50
OPROG_IF OIF_USER_RACE ! RACE_OGRE 2 0
P 2
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_JUNK
P 3
TRIG_UNKNOWN 100 ogrehq
OPROG_IF OIF_USER_RACE = RACE_OGRE 4 0
P 4
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_IF OIF_USER_PERCENT_HITPT > 89 5 7
P 5
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_GOD_COMMAND
mpgoto 1853~
